@startuml

!include ../C4_Component.puml

title Device Management Service - Command Processing Sequence

actor User
participant API_Gateway
participant DeviceManagementController
participant CommandProcessor
participant DeviceStateManager
database DeviceDB
participant EventPublisher
participant Kafka

User -> API_Gateway : Sends device control command
API_Gateway -> DeviceManagementController : Routes request
DeviceManagementController -> CommandProcessor : Processes command
CommandProcessor -> DeviceStateManager : Updates device state
DeviceStateManager -> DeviceDB : Stores new device state
CommandProcessor -> EventPublisher : Publishes event to Kafka
EventPublisher -> Kafka : Sends event
Kafka -> DeviceManagementService : Consumes device-related event
DeviceManagementService -> DeviceStateManager : Updates device state based on event
DeviceStateManager -> DeviceDB : Stores new device state

@enduml